# Calculated cells

A bracketed cell is a calculation that can read named values from any note.

[$1.50]:unit_price
[6]:bulk_qty

[extras] := table
| item | quantity   | cost             |
| ---- | ---------- | ---------------- |
| bulk | [bulk_qty] | [unit_price]     |
| jam  | 1          | [unit_price * 3] |

[extras_total] := sum(extras, quantity * cost)

Extras cost [extras_total].

<!-- Each calculated cell shows its value as an inlay. Try: change bulk_qty. -->
